@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### Standard array response: GET /cats
GET {{baseUrl}}/cats
Accept: application/json

### Standard string response: GET /cats/message
GET {{baseUrl}}/cats/message
Accept: text/plain

### Native Express response: GET /cats/native
GET {{baseUrl}}/cats/native

### Passthrough status, response header, cookie, and JSON body
GET {{baseUrl}}/cats/passthrough
Accept: application/json

### Primitive number response: GET /cats/count
GET {{baseUrl}}/cats/count
Accept: text/plain

### POST /cats with @HttpCode(202)
POST {{baseUrl}}/cats
Accept: application/json

### @Next() forwards an error to Express
GET {{baseUrl}}/cats/next-error

### @Next('route') skips the current route
GET {{baseUrl}}/cats/next-route

### @Next('router') exits the current Express router
GET {{baseUrl}}/cats/next-router

### Host 匹配：应该返回 account=tenant
GET {{baseUrl}}/context/host-param
Host: tenant.example.com
Accept: application/json

### Host 不匹配：应该返回 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/context/host-param
Host: other.example.net
Accept: application/json

### 1. 登录：看响应头里的 Set-Cookie，值形如 s%3Aadmin.<签名>
GET {{baseUrl}}/demo/login

### 2. 带合法签名的 Cookie：signedCookies 里能读到 role=admin
GET {{baseUrl}}/demo/whoami
Cookie: role=s%3Aadmin.KaTCh9g4%2FUIqDygb%2BppF0oSPALwMD0JUrCvLEWZ666w

### 3. 篡改：把值 admin 手改成 root，签名没变 → signedCookies 为空
GET {{baseUrl}}/demo/whoami
Cookie: role=s%3Aroot.KaTCh9g4%2FUIqDygb%2BppF0oSPALwMD0JUrCvLEWZ666w

### 4. 不签名的普通 Cookie：cookies 能读到，signedCookies 为空
GET {{baseUrl}}/demo/whoami
Cookie: role=admin